This repository contains no Olympus / OM Digital Solutions firmware. The builder downloads the
official firmware from OM's own server on the user's machine.

Third-party:
- external/oly_fw_analysis (git submodule, fishcu): PEN-F firmware research and MN103 emulator harness,
  used by the developer verification tools only. It is not part of Caduceus and keeps its own licence
  (GPL-3.0 for its code); it is not needed to build or install Caduceus.
- Community film recipes are credited to their authors in docs/LIBRARY_V1.md.

